WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.284 --> 00:00:05.785
Hey, Jen.

00:00:05.785 --> 00:00:07.245
So good to see you.

00:00:07.245 --> 00:00:09.706
I love that you never
make any effort at all.

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:11.249
What are you doing here?

00:00:11.249 --> 00:00:13.877
This is my friend's
very real wedding.

00:00:13.877 --> 00:00:15.378
You can't pull your crap here.

00:00:15.378 --> 00:00:17.922
Oh, okay. Well, I see
the chit chat is over.

00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:21.051
The answer to your extremely
rude question is that

00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:22.427
I happen to be dating

00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:25.263
a friend of the groom,
and he invited me.

00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:27.724
Titania!

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:28.641
Hey girl, hey!

00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:29.434
You made it.

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:30.769
You're so busy, though.

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:32.854
You have like, what? 
5000 businesses?

00:00:32.854 --> 00:00:33.646
I do.

00:00:33.897 --> 00:00:35.148
What? No, no.

00:00:35.148 --> 00:00:38.443
She has weaseled her way into
this wedding to mess with me.

00:00:38.443 --> 00:00:39.611
That is so obvious.

00:00:39.611 --> 00:00:41.321
Why does nobody else see that?

00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:44.240
Okay, you're being
very loud.

00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:47.285
Jen, I hear you, again.

00:00:47.285 --> 00:00:50.747
I do. But you sound
insane right now.

00:00:51.206 --> 00:00:52.457
Like, Titania wouldn't just 

00:00:52.457 --> 00:00:55.293
show up to my wedding, you know,
try and kill you or something.

00:00:55.293 --> 00:00:55.960
I don't know.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.380
I'm literally just here
to celebrate the love of Lulu

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:01.758
and her groom, that's all. Okay?

